 ntly design and print gig posters for counterculture\, rock\, and jam band
 s performing throughout North America. Psychedelic Splendor brings these c
 entral Connecticut artists together for their first museum exhibition\, fe
 aturing more than seventy of their "greatest hits": posters for Black Sabb
 ath\, Dave Matthews Band\, Dead & Company\, Foo Fighters\, Goose\, The Gra
 teful Dead\, Pearl Jam\, Phish\, and more.Sponsored by Keith and Jane Mahl
 er\, Premier Concerts\, and Manic Presents\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/
